WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.960
=Episode 22=

01:50.026 --> 01:50.826
Dad, Mom.

01:50.826 --> 01:52.106
Have you eaten?

01:52.700 --> 01:54.648
The paper is sending me
to the epicenter.

01:56.787 --> 01:57.587
The epicenter?

01:58.826 --> 02:00.026
That's dangerous.

02:00.186 --> 02:01.306
Only by going on site

02:01.960 --> 02:03.380
can we get first-hand information.

02:03.746 --> 02:04.666
Don't worry.

02:04.867 --> 02:06.587
I'll only be working on the outskirts.

02:07.147 --> 02:07.826
But,

02:08.426 --> 02:09.266
does Fei Ni know?

02:14.787 --> 02:16.347
I'll call the factory in a minute.

02:22.507 --> 02:23.146
Hello?

02:23.546 --> 02:24.706
Hi, I'm looking for Fei Ni.

02:24.706 --> 02:26.546
Fang Muyang? It's Ms. Liu.

02:26.826 --> 02:27.586
Ms. Liu.

02:27.848 --> 02:29.048
Fei Ni's in Workshop Three.

02:29.120 --> 02:29.826
I'll go get her.

02:29.826 --> 02:30.386
Ms. Liu.

02:32.307 --> 02:32.907
No need.

02:33.826 --> 02:34.627
I'm short on time.

02:36.027 --> 02:37.187
Please pass a message for me.

02:38.507 --> 02:39.507
What?

02:39.507 --> 02:40.227
The epicenter?

02:40.227 --> 02:41.307
And he's leaving right away.

02:42.426 --> 02:44.106
Ms. Liu, I'm taking half a day off.

02:44.106 --> 02:44.947
Wait...

02:57.787 --> 03:00.386
(Chief Editor's Office)
Comrades, the leadership has ordered

03:00.386 --> 03:02.227
Jiangcheng Daily,

03:02.227 --> 03:03.426
the magazine office,

03:03.426 --> 03:04.507
and the publishing house,

03:04.507 --> 03:05.907
to form

03:05.907 --> 03:06.747
a reporting team

03:06.907 --> 03:09.347
(to head to the front lines
of earthquake relief)

03:09.426 --> 03:11.787
for on-site coverage.

03:11.826 --> 03:14.826
(Safety First)
The first priority is safety.

03:15.147 --> 03:18.508
(2 Political Discipline, 3 Supplies)
Only by ensuring your own safety

03:18.586 --> 03:22.106
(Information Verification)
can you complete your reporting duties.

03:22.907 --> 03:25.627
This is an honorable
and demanding mission.

03:25.826 --> 03:28.986
It's also a test
from the Party and the people.

03:29.986 --> 03:32.307
We look forward to you

03:32.307 --> 03:33.907
fulfilling your mission with honor

03:34.586 --> 03:36.227
and returning in triumph.

03:36.747 --> 03:39.106
Comrades, can I count on you?

03:39.537 --> 03:42.226
- We will accomplish the mission.
- We will accomplish the mission.

04:13.706 --> 04:14.507
Editor Liao.

04:15.907 --> 04:16.826
Where's Fang Muyang?

04:18.107 --> 04:19.226
He's on this bus.

04:22.386 --> 04:23.427
Fang Muyang!

04:25.146 --> 04:26.586
Fang Muyang!

05:07.346 --> 05:08.146
Fei Ni.

05:09.697 --> 05:12.935
♪In spring, I think of you♪

05:12.987 --> 05:13.786
Fei Ni!

05:16.735 --> 05:21.672
♪In summer, I think of you♪

05:23.980 --> 05:30.260
♪When autumn leaves fall,
you belong to me♪

05:30.472 --> 05:33.935
♪When the world is covered in snow♪

05:33.987 --> 05:35.307
Why are you here?

05:40.547 --> 05:42.026
Do you really have to go?

05:42.122 --> 05:46.697
♪There is a small place♪

05:46.747 --> 05:47.547
Fei Ni,

05:48.706 --> 05:49.699
I have to go.

05:49.700 --> 05:51.093
They need me in the disaster area.

05:51.182 --> 05:52.140
At a time like this,

05:53.786 --> 05:55.547
educated youth can't
be afraid of hardship

05:55.667 --> 05:56.307
exhaustion,

05:56.947 --> 05:57.947
or danger.

05:59.810 --> 06:00.266
I...

06:01.147 --> 06:02.587
I know I can't stop you.

06:04.947 --> 06:06.266
Just come back safe.

06:07.586 --> 06:08.627
I'll wait for you.

06:08.985 --> 06:15.140
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

06:16.140 --> 06:22.285
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

06:22.972 --> 06:28.522
♪My love,
walking toward the distance♪

06:28.586 --> 06:29.427
I'm going.

06:30.260 --> 06:37.747
♪Remember, that's me thinking of you♪

06:57.627 --> 06:58.107
Mujing,

06:58.706 --> 07:00.667
I'm staying with my parents
for a few days.

07:01.346 --> 07:01.947
Also,

07:02.107 --> 07:03.826
don't stay in this building too long.

07:03.826 --> 07:04.507
Be careful.

07:04.947 --> 07:05.507
Okay.

07:07.187 --> 07:07.786
I'm off.

07:24.297 --> 07:26.069
(It's cold. I bought you a sweater.
Hope it fits. It's your favorite color.)

07:26.070 --> 07:27.004
(Share the candies with the others,
except Liu Wei.)

07:27.010 --> 07:27.848
(Save the canned food for yourself.
Qu Hua.)

07:43.507 --> 07:44.507
Why are you here?

07:45.226 --> 07:46.307
Did you finish surgery?

07:47.706 --> 07:48.466
Yes.

07:50.937 --> 07:52.420
You didn't sleep all night, did you?

07:53.107 --> 07:54.226
Were there many casualties?

07:54.547 --> 07:55.427
Before I came,

07:55.706 --> 07:57.386
I'd just completed my eighth operation.

08:02.547 --> 08:03.547
Where are you going?

08:06.826 --> 08:07.706
I received orders

08:08.307 --> 08:09.507
to support the epicenter.

08:11.427 --> 08:12.266
For how long?

08:12.627 --> 08:14.906
I'll come back when all the injured

08:15.547 --> 08:16.667
are treated.

08:26.266 --> 08:27.947
I came to tell you something.

08:36.667 --> 08:38.427
I've already signed
the divorce agreement.

08:40.410 --> 08:43.397
(Divorce Agreement.
Parties: Fang Mujing, Qu Hua.)

08:44.307 --> 08:45.267
What do you mean?

08:47.226 --> 08:48.947
If you want a divorce, just say it.

08:49.626 --> 08:50.746
Sign it sooner,

08:50.746 --> 08:52.427
and we can go our separate ways.

08:52.560 --> 08:54.060
Why did you transfer to Jiangcheng?

09:02.067 --> 09:03.907
The epicenter is
the most dangerous area.

09:05.106 --> 09:05.907
I heard

09:06.947 --> 09:08.466
that among the first group who went,

09:09.866 --> 09:11.067
some were injured,

09:11.866 --> 09:13.787
and some died in aftershocks.

09:16.106 --> 09:17.547
I signed the divorce agreement

09:19.346 --> 09:20.466
because I wanted to tell you

09:21.307 --> 09:23.067
that if something happens to me,

09:23.907 --> 09:25.466
then when you leave me,

09:27.746 --> 09:29.106
you won't feel too burdened.

09:37.506 --> 09:38.466
So you think

09:40.706 --> 09:42.547
that if something happens to you,

09:43.466 --> 09:44.787
I'd divorce you?

09:47.106 --> 09:48.667
I said if something happens,

09:52.547 --> 09:53.706
I'll divorce you.

10:03.137 --> 10:05.271
(Divorce Agreement.
Parties: Fang Mujing, Qu Hua.)

10:23.466 --> 10:24.147
Qu Hua,

10:25.947 --> 10:27.466
I'm just a wife.

10:29.147 --> 10:30.187
All I know is that

10:30.866 --> 10:32.947
if the person I love is hurt,

10:34.746 --> 10:36.027
he'll only need me more.

11:05.346 --> 11:06.746
Take care of yourself.

11:07.427 --> 11:08.226
Don't get hurt.

11:10.746 --> 11:12.307
Only then can you save more people.

11:18.746 --> 11:19.226
Wait for me.

12:20.447 --> 12:22.810
(Fang Muyang,
there wasn't much time.)

12:23.097 --> 12:25.417
(I could only get
these biscuits and canned food.)

12:25.586 --> 12:28.387
(I also brought you
Huoxiang Zhengqi essence and iodine.)

12:28.387 --> 12:31.106
(And some medicine
for fever and diarrhea.)

12:32.547 --> 12:33.067
Fei Ni.

12:33.586 --> 12:34.106
Here.

12:34.667 --> 12:36.067
(The food is from Lin Mei.)

12:36.226 --> 12:37.387
(She helped get it.)

12:37.982 --> 12:39.137
(As for the medicine,)

12:39.427 --> 12:41.106
(I asked Nurse Zhou for it.)

12:41.337 --> 12:42.404
(She refused at first,)

12:42.420 --> 12:44.900
(but when she heard you were
supporting the disaster area,)

12:44.907 --> 12:46.346
(she managed to gather some.)

12:46.826 --> 12:48.387
(You have to come back.)

12:48.506 --> 12:49.787
(There are too many favors.)

12:50.147 --> 12:51.547
(I can't repay them alone.)

12:54.222 --> 13:00.622
♪There is a small place♪

13:01.300 --> 13:07.420
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

13:08.260 --> 13:15.180
♪Every lovely face♪

13:15.940 --> 13:21.780
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

13:22.540 --> 13:28.500
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

13:29.260 --> 13:35.820
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

13:36.620 --> 13:43.740
♪You belong to me, you see the light♪

13:43.740 --> 13:52.100
♪Remember, that's me thinking of you♪

13:52.100 --> 13:58.910
(Conquer fate. Overcome the disaster.
Our hearts are with Beishan.)

14:12.197 --> 14:16.022
(List of Missing Persons)

14:45.506 --> 14:46.147
Comrade,

14:46.147 --> 14:47.307
are you from Jiangcheng Daily?

14:47.427 --> 14:47.866
Yes.

14:47.947 --> 14:48.387
Follow me.

14:50.515 --> 14:51.370
(Temporary Communications Post)

14:58.893 --> 15:00.182
Comrades from Jiangcheng Daily,

15:00.387 --> 15:01.586
sorry to have you stay here

15:01.626 --> 15:02.427
to work and write.

15:02.537 --> 15:04.260
Communications haven't
fully recovered yet.

15:04.506 --> 15:06.099
So we can only come back once a week

15:06.100 --> 15:07.115
to deliver your papers.

15:07.226 --> 15:08.586
And only to your newspaper office.

15:09.427 --> 15:10.226
What about you?

15:10.746 --> 15:11.547
Where are you based?

15:11.626 --> 15:12.907
We're closer to the epicenter.

15:12.947 --> 15:14.586
Rescue work is still ongoing there.

15:14.746 --> 15:15.586
But here,

15:15.586 --> 15:16.667
you're safe.

15:16.866 --> 15:17.947
All right. Thank you.

15:22.010 --> 15:26.460
(Earthquake Relief)

15:34.307 --> 15:35.027
Fang,

15:36.067 --> 15:37.667
this is probably your first time here.

15:37.667 --> 15:39.210
(Earthquake Relief)
You don't have much experience.

15:39.226 --> 15:40.147
Let me explain.

15:40.907 --> 15:42.667
For example,
since today is our first day,

15:43.226 --> 15:44.626
you can start by sketching

15:44.626 --> 15:46.506
the journey we took to get here,

15:46.826 --> 15:48.706
including the soldiers who received us.

15:49.067 --> 15:49.947
You can also interview

15:50.187 --> 15:52.267
the evacuees
returning from the disaster area.

15:52.626 --> 15:54.267
No need to overthink it at first.

15:54.506 --> 15:56.147
Just start gathering material.

15:57.506 --> 15:58.027
Of course,

15:59.147 --> 16:01.267
if nothing comes to you right away,

16:01.787 --> 16:02.746
that's fine.

16:02.947 --> 16:03.346
For now,

16:03.506 --> 16:04.466
get some rest first.

16:11.980 --> 16:13.737
Please help me.

16:13.782 --> 16:14.790
(List of Missing Persons)

16:17.380 --> 16:18.782
(Temporary Communications Post)

16:21.826 --> 16:22.427
Comrade.

16:23.586 --> 16:24.187
Comrade.

16:24.404 --> 16:25.640
I need to go to the epicenter.

16:26.506 --> 16:27.947
I want to join the relief team.

16:28.160 --> 16:29.300
I'm not afraid of danger.

16:29.671 --> 16:30.940
(Rebuild Our Homes)
In surgery,

16:30.947 --> 16:31.907
the earlier we act,

16:31.907 --> 16:33.346
the better the chance of survival.

16:33.907 --> 16:35.940
Lives can't wait.
The closer my operating table

16:35.947 --> 16:37.147
is to the disaster victims,

16:37.147 --> 16:38.907
the higher their chances of surviving.

16:39.147 --> 16:40.427
I can build emergency shelters.

16:40.907 --> 16:41.826
I can do carpentry.

16:42.106 --> 16:43.147
I can assemble stretchers.

16:43.746 --> 16:44.459
I'm strong.

16:44.460 --> 16:46.182
I can help move rubble
and rescue people.

16:46.248 --> 16:47.100
That may be true,

16:47.106 --> 16:47.866
but we also

16:47.866 --> 16:49.067
have to ensure

16:49.067 --> 16:50.746
the safety of our support personnel.

16:50.746 --> 16:52.267
The epicenter is extremely dangerous.

16:52.267 --> 16:53.466
I can guarantee my own safety.

16:54.027 --> 16:55.626
But if I take just a little more risk,

16:55.671 --> 16:57.140
even if it means saving one more life,

16:57.147 --> 16:58.067
it's worth it.

16:58.067 --> 16:59.147
I could draw 1,000 pictures,

17:00.226 --> 17:01.826
and saving one life still matters more.

17:02.547 --> 17:03.067
Sir,

17:03.706 --> 17:05.147
please approve my request.

17:06.107 --> 17:07.107
Let my operating table

17:07.271 --> 17:08.804
be a little closer to the epicenter.

17:09.546 --> 17:11.667
I'll apply to the head
of the press delegation.

17:12.306 --> 17:12.786
All right.

17:12.786 --> 17:13.907
I'll report to my superior.

17:14.466 --> 17:15.266
Thank you.

17:26.347 --> 17:27.147
Take cover!

17:46.826 --> 17:47.782
Hang in there!

17:52.947 --> 17:53.266
Quick!

17:53.546 --> 17:54.147
Hurry!

17:55.667 --> 17:56.347
Hey...

17:56.471 --> 17:57.804
- Stay with us.
- Fang Muyang!

17:58.907 --> 17:59.506
Brother-in-law?

17:59.706 --> 18:00.427
Why are you here?

18:00.706 --> 18:01.587
The newspaper sent me.

18:01.786 --> 18:02.427
Move!

18:07.706 --> 18:08.347
Fei Ni.

18:09.947 --> 18:11.986
Is there any news about Fang Muyang?

18:15.347 --> 18:16.907
Yang is...

18:16.907 --> 18:17.786
He...

18:20.387 --> 18:22.466
He went to the epicenter,
the most dangerous part.

18:24.466 --> 18:28.306
He joined the troops
in earthquake relief work.

18:29.667 --> 18:30.466
But

18:30.667 --> 18:32.387
don't worry too much.

18:33.546 --> 18:35.587
From what we know so far,

18:36.147 --> 18:37.107
he's safe,

18:38.506 --> 18:39.546
and not injured.

18:42.947 --> 18:44.147
I know that boy.

18:45.506 --> 18:46.266
He's quick-witted.

18:46.627 --> 18:47.746
He'll be fine.

18:50.506 --> 18:51.387
I understand.

18:52.147 --> 18:54.107
But if there's any more news
about Fang Muyang,

18:54.107 --> 18:55.746
please tell me right away.

18:55.986 --> 18:56.786
All right?

18:56.986 --> 18:57.786
Of course.

18:58.786 --> 18:59.587
Don't worry.

19:00.187 --> 19:01.387
Thank you, Uncle Fu.

19:14.786 --> 19:15.587
Brother-in-law,

19:16.466 --> 19:17.587
can you mail letters?

19:19.107 --> 19:20.259
All efforts are focused

19:20.260 --> 19:21.426
on essential communications.

19:21.515 --> 19:23.140
Regular letters might not get through.

19:25.786 --> 19:26.427
What's wrong?

19:29.515 --> 19:31.404
I've written so many letters to Fei Ni,

19:32.293 --> 19:33.380
but I can't send them.

19:36.786 --> 19:37.746
You and your sister

19:38.187 --> 19:39.147
are really different.

19:40.782 --> 19:42.540
Ever since I was little,
my parents said

19:42.986 --> 19:44.147
I'm not like the Fang family,

19:45.266 --> 19:46.266
not like my sister.

19:47.187 --> 19:48.667
She's exactly like my mom.

19:51.786 --> 19:52.587
Brother-in-law,

19:54.387 --> 19:55.506
do you miss my sister?

19:58.066 --> 19:58.867
I do.

20:16.587 --> 20:17.746
I miss Fei Ni, too.

20:30.506 --> 20:31.306
Mujing,

20:31.867 --> 20:33.587
have you received a reply from him?

20:35.907 --> 20:36.506
No.

20:46.786 --> 20:48.867
I heard Fang Muyang went
to the epicenter.

20:54.867 --> 20:55.667
Don't worry.

20:56.867 --> 20:57.546
He's always

20:57.693 --> 20:59.337
been the type to show off his toughness.

20:59.786 --> 21:02.147
Even when he was sent down,
he chose the hardest place.

21:03.387 --> 21:04.706
He's like a bronze pea,

21:05.107 --> 21:06.466
impossible to go soft.

21:08.107 --> 21:10.187
My parents never knew how to handle him.

21:11.107 --> 21:12.226
I doubt this earthquake

21:12.907 --> 21:14.387
can do much to him either.

21:17.147 --> 21:18.506
I hope so.

21:26.746 --> 21:27.546
Look.

21:28.066 --> 21:29.667
The moon is so full tonight.

21:32.147 --> 21:34.147
Mujing, do you think

21:35.546 --> 21:36.627
they can see

21:37.506 --> 21:38.986
a moon this full, too?

21:42.506 --> 21:43.147
They can.

21:44.500 --> 21:45.448
They definitely can.

22:06.986 --> 22:07.627
Slow down.

22:21.827 --> 22:24.226
Aftershock! Run!

22:24.226 --> 22:24.986
Go!

22:24.986 --> 22:25.827
Move!

22:25.947 --> 22:26.786
Hurry!

22:32.546 --> 22:33.107
Run!

22:36.604 --> 22:39.300
(The educated youth who were
once sent to Great Northern Wilderness)

22:39.706 --> 22:41.387
(are now playing a vital role again)

22:41.387 --> 22:43.266
(in the earthquake-stricken area.)

22:43.986 --> 22:44.706
(Yesterday,)

22:44.827 --> 22:47.706
(a 6.2-magnitude aftershock
struck the epicenter.)

22:47.915 --> 22:49.020
(The Youth Rescue Team)

22:49.026 --> 22:50.986
(supporting the disaster area)

22:50.986 --> 22:52.187
(charged to the front)

22:52.667 --> 22:54.546
(and rescued many victims.)

22:55.066 --> 22:57.746
(Eight members
of the rescue team were injured,)

22:57.986 --> 22:59.466
(three of them in serious condition.)

23:00.060 --> 23:01.871
(It is reported
that this rescue team is)

23:01.910 --> 23:05.066
(made up entirely of returned educated
youth from Great Northern Wilderness.)

23:05.347 --> 23:05.907
(They...)

23:13.306 --> 23:15.706
Dad, Mom, did you hear that?

23:15.706 --> 23:16.827
They just said

23:16.827 --> 23:18.947
someone from the Educated Youth
Rescue Team was injured.

23:18.947 --> 23:19.820
Could it be Fang Muyang?

23:19.848 --> 23:20.500
Don't panic.

23:20.907 --> 23:22.066
You heard the broadcast.

23:22.266 --> 23:23.746
It was the rescue team who were hurt.

23:23.986 --> 23:25.546
Isn't Fang Muyang there as a reporter?

23:25.546 --> 23:27.746
The newspaper said
he already joined the rescue team.

23:28.786 --> 23:29.907
No. I need to find out more.

23:30.226 --> 23:31.786
- Where are you going?
- Where?

23:32.387 --> 23:33.226
Ni!

23:33.410 --> 23:36.760
(Long live the Communist Party)

23:40.706 --> 23:41.546
Uncle Fu,

23:41.786 --> 23:43.026
did you hear the broadcast?

23:43.627 --> 23:44.827
Fei Ni, don't panic.

23:44.986 --> 23:46.187
Calm down.

23:47.026 --> 23:48.347
I heard it.

23:48.786 --> 23:50.226
They didn't say

23:50.226 --> 23:51.827
it was Fang Muyang.

23:52.226 --> 23:54.506
But there's been no news for days.

23:54.986 --> 23:56.827
Has Mr. Xu written back?

23:57.147 --> 23:59.986
Xu Yong's next batch of articles

23:59.986 --> 24:02.026
won't arrive for another four days.

24:02.187 --> 24:02.907
Besides,

24:03.266 --> 24:05.026
he isn't on your husband's team.

24:06.422 --> 24:07.306
Then what do we do?

24:07.306 --> 24:08.587
What if he's hurt?

24:08.827 --> 24:10.986
The broadcast said
some were seriously injured.

24:11.706 --> 24:12.506
Fei Ni,

24:13.190 --> 24:14.710
as soon as there's any news,

24:14.710 --> 24:16.990
I'll tell you right away, all right?

24:18.587 --> 24:19.066
No...

24:24.185 --> 24:25.960
(Serious and Earnest)

24:27.347 --> 24:28.667
Why would you go to the epicenter?

24:29.427 --> 24:31.706
My husband, Fang Muyang,
went there to provide support.

24:32.306 --> 24:33.226
I'm going to find him.

24:41.187 --> 24:41.907
Fei Ni,

24:43.226 --> 24:45.187
I understand how you feel.

24:46.427 --> 24:47.026
But

24:47.746 --> 24:50.306
even if Comrade Fang Muyang
really is injured,

24:50.471 --> 24:52.620
there are medical teams
from all over the country

24:52.627 --> 24:54.187
stationed at the epicenter.

24:54.667 --> 24:56.387
They will take good care of him.

24:56.827 --> 24:57.627
Ms. Xu,

24:57.848 --> 24:59.871
there are so many injured people there.

24:59.982 --> 25:02.300
I don't know
if the doctors can look after him.

25:02.387 --> 25:03.587
Please let me go.

25:07.827 --> 25:09.667
Why won't you listen?

25:09.907 --> 25:11.107
I'm not letting you go

25:11.107 --> 25:12.907
because I'm concerned about your safety.

25:12.907 --> 25:14.827
But I don't even know if he's safe.

25:14.827 --> 25:16.107
I have to go.

25:29.907 --> 25:30.546
All right.

25:31.986 --> 25:32.546
Remember,

25:33.204 --> 25:34.893
when you see Comrade Fang Muyang,

25:35.266 --> 25:36.986
please convey my regards.

25:37.706 --> 25:38.506
Tell him

25:38.986 --> 25:41.466
he has always been a hero
of Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory.

25:47.147 --> 25:47.947
Thank you, Ms. Xu.

26:01.266 --> 26:01.907
Ni,

26:03.147 --> 26:04.187
they say

26:04.827 --> 26:06.746
supplies are tight in the disaster area.

26:07.986 --> 26:09.466
Take all this food with you.

26:14.506 --> 26:15.306
Ni,

26:16.226 --> 26:17.347
once you reach the epicenter,

26:17.627 --> 26:18.706
find Fang.

26:19.627 --> 26:20.746
As long as he's safe,

26:21.093 --> 26:22.380
you two come back right away.

26:26.026 --> 26:27.266
And tell

26:27.867 --> 26:28.627
Fang...

26:30.827 --> 26:31.706
Well...

26:32.506 --> 26:35.546
I've got a good bottle
of liquor stashed at home.

26:36.187 --> 26:37.226
I'm waiting for him.

26:37.826 --> 26:39.737
When he's back,
we'll drink it together.

26:40.746 --> 26:41.986
I know, Dad.

26:42.907 --> 26:43.867
I'll tell him.

26:44.026 --> 26:44.960
Don't worry.

26:46.506 --> 26:48.706
He can't hold his liquor.

26:48.827 --> 26:50.667
When he comes back, go easy on him.

26:50.667 --> 26:51.160
All right?

26:54.187 --> 26:55.746
He won't get drunk.

27:03.306 --> 27:03.627
Mom.

27:04.867 --> 27:05.147
Dad.

27:05.147 --> 27:05.506
I...

27:06.347 --> 27:06.986
I'm going.

27:12.986 --> 27:13.827
Stay safe.

27:15.786 --> 27:16.786
Stay safe.

27:29.587 --> 27:30.306
You go.

27:33.627 --> 27:34.706
Let go.

27:35.347 --> 27:35.907
Go.

28:38.922 --> 28:42.960
(Grid Manuscript Paper)

28:56.667 --> 28:57.387
Mujing!

28:57.947 --> 28:58.506
Mujing!

28:59.071 --> 29:00.780
There was another
5.8-magnitude aftershock

29:00.786 --> 29:02.667
at the epicenter.

29:02.667 --> 29:03.947
The number of casualties

29:03.947 --> 29:05.107
hasn't been confirmed yet.

29:05.266 --> 29:06.107
I know.

29:06.107 --> 29:08.147
Your brother and your husband
are both there.

29:08.667 --> 29:09.947
Have you heard from them?

29:30.266 --> 29:30.867
Don't worry.

29:31.506 --> 29:33.706
They'll be fine.

30:27.266 --> 30:28.306
Thank you, Sir.

30:31.546 --> 30:32.226
Comrade,

30:32.706 --> 30:33.746
do you know Fang Muyang?

30:33.746 --> 30:34.387
No.

30:34.848 --> 30:36.147
One at a time.

30:36.306 --> 30:37.947
My husband's name is Li Weihui.

30:39.427 --> 30:39.947
Comrade,

30:40.387 --> 30:41.627
do you know Fang Muyang?

30:41.627 --> 30:42.107
No.

30:43.026 --> 30:44.306
Where's the medical station?

30:44.306 --> 30:45.066
Over there.

31:00.667 --> 31:01.187
Mom.

31:02.427 --> 31:03.947
Sorry to trouble you.

31:15.907 --> 31:16.706
Miss,

31:16.867 --> 31:18.060
do you know Fang Muyang?

31:18.060 --> 31:18.860
No.

31:36.546 --> 31:38.066
Are all the injured here?

31:38.066 --> 31:39.026
There are more inside.

31:45.035 --> 31:48.060
(Earthquake Relief Medical Team)

32:01.706 --> 32:03.226
Doctor, save him!

32:04.107 --> 32:04.627
Quick!

32:04.746 --> 32:05.546
What happened?

32:05.706 --> 32:06.867
It looks like broken ribs.

32:06.940 --> 32:08.204
He needs surgery immediately.

32:08.210 --> 32:09.280
Quick, get him into surgery.

32:09.306 --> 32:09.947
Hurry.

32:11.885 --> 32:14.797
(Operating Room)

32:22.306 --> 32:23.107
Fang Muyang?

32:35.387 --> 32:36.187
Fei Ni?

32:48.972 --> 32:50.497
(Man Can Conquer Nature)

32:50.546 --> 32:52.107
Why is no one here?

32:52.226 --> 32:53.893
The people staying here are soldiers.

32:53.947 --> 32:55.066
They're all at the epicenter.

32:55.667 --> 32:56.786
They'll be back tomorrow.

32:58.986 --> 33:01.066
I have a towel here, brand new.

33:01.466 --> 33:02.187
Brand new.

33:02.427 --> 33:03.059
Keep it safe.

33:03.060 --> 33:04.271
I'll take it to the infirmary.

33:07.066 --> 33:07.706
Are you hungry?

33:12.107 --> 33:13.627
I brought noodles.

33:13.627 --> 33:14.627
I can cook them for you.

33:14.740 --> 33:15.848
We can't cook noodles here.

33:24.546 --> 33:25.347
Why did you come?

33:28.427 --> 33:30.187
I heard on the radio

33:31.266 --> 33:32.706
there were aftershocks here,

33:32.706 --> 33:34.427
and many people were injured,

33:35.627 --> 33:36.706
including educated youth.

33:37.667 --> 33:38.306
I wrote to you,

33:38.306 --> 33:40.347
and you never replied.

33:40.827 --> 33:42.587
I just went around asking

33:43.427 --> 33:45.306
at several of the relief shelters.

33:45.746 --> 33:47.306
They all said they didn't know you.

33:47.667 --> 33:48.827
I started getting scared.

33:48.827 --> 33:49.746
I was afraid you had...

33:51.107 --> 33:52.187
All right, all right.

33:52.506 --> 33:53.667
Don't cry.

33:57.867 --> 33:59.066
See? I'm fine.

34:00.667 --> 34:02.387
Look at me. I'm not hurt.

34:13.580 --> 34:14.226
By the way,

34:14.860 --> 34:15.826
look at this.

34:16.804 --> 34:18.300
I drew these over the past few days.

34:19.347 --> 34:20.267
What do you think?

34:41.307 --> 34:42.347
You're hurt.

34:42.907 --> 34:43.466
You...

34:44.227 --> 34:45.106
How did this happen?

34:47.506 --> 34:48.146
It's nothing.

34:50.026 --> 34:53.760
I got hit
while rescuing an older man.

34:55.867 --> 34:57.907
He'd been pinned down
for four days.

35:00.271 --> 35:02.180
When we got him out,
he had only one leg left.

35:04.146 --> 35:05.427
But he stayed optimistic.

35:07.146 --> 35:08.546
He said once he recovered,

35:08.693 --> 35:09.740
he'd make steamed buns

35:09.747 --> 35:10.666
to thank us.

35:20.347 --> 35:21.546
After we pulled him out,

35:25.707 --> 35:26.827
we found out

35:27.620 --> 35:29.137
there was another beneath him.

35:31.626 --> 35:32.666
A little girl,

35:34.427 --> 35:35.787
about six or seven years old.

35:37.546 --> 35:39.546
Her lower body was
pinned under a slab of stone.

35:41.066 --> 35:42.947
I kept singing her children's songs.

35:49.747 --> 35:50.867
Pull the radish...

35:52.146 --> 35:53.267
Pull the radish...

36:05.307 --> 36:05.907
She said...

36:07.380 --> 36:08.493
She said, "Sir..."

36:13.947 --> 36:15.427
"I'm just a little radish."

36:19.146 --> 36:20.666
"You have to pull me out."

36:28.026 --> 36:29.707
But in the end, we still...

36:55.110 --> 36:56.064
Fei Ni.

36:58.360 --> 36:59.760
I'm heading to the infirmary,

37:01.146 --> 37:02.387
and then the epicenter.

37:02.907 --> 37:03.707
I'll find

37:03.947 --> 37:05.947
a relief supply truck to take you back.

37:07.947 --> 37:09.072
I'm not going back.

37:09.347 --> 37:10.427
It's too dangerous.

37:11.804 --> 37:14.182
- There are aftershocks every day.
- I'm not afraid!

37:16.546 --> 37:17.947
Chairman Mao said

37:18.227 --> 37:19.827
women hold up half the sky.

37:19.827 --> 37:21.867
Whatever you can do, I can do, too.

37:23.466 --> 37:24.707
Don't look down on me.

37:26.797 --> 37:28.672
Rescue team, assemble.

37:37.867 --> 37:38.666
All right.

37:40.347 --> 37:41.307
Then we'll go together.

37:43.106 --> 37:43.947
Let's go.

38:25.535 --> 38:26.997
(Earthquake Relief Medical Team)

38:31.472 --> 38:33.472
(Operating Room)

38:38.347 --> 38:39.026
Aftershock!

38:39.347 --> 38:39.947
Run!

39:04.140 --> 39:05.404
(The earthquake relief work)

39:05.471 --> 39:08.060
(Focus on quality, ensure supply)
(has entered a critical stage.)

39:08.626 --> 39:11.466
(People across the country are
supporting the disaster area.)

39:11.737 --> 39:13.140
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

39:13.387 --> 39:14.707
(is boosting production,)

39:14.707 --> 39:15.867
(Deepen efforts to boost production)
(increasing output,)

39:15.867 --> 39:17.960
(support the disaster area)
(and ensuring quality.)

39:17.982 --> 39:19.020
(That is the most direct)

39:19.026 --> 39:21.787
(and powerful support
for earthquake relief efforts.)

39:22.267 --> 39:24.986
(An earthquake cannot
destroy the power of hope.)

39:24.986 --> 39:28.235
(Hardship cannot
stop the steps of confidence.)

39:29.685 --> 39:50.360
(Archival Footage)

39:53.707 --> 39:54.466
Zhou,

39:54.537 --> 39:56.271
(Mailbox)
is there no letter from my family?

39:56.382 --> 39:56.980
No.

39:57.146 --> 39:58.506
Did you check carefully?

39:58.860 --> 40:00.004
There's really nothing.

40:07.146 --> 40:07.867
I heard

40:07.867 --> 40:10.227
many who went to support
the disaster area have come back.

40:11.347 --> 40:12.227
Why haven't we heard

40:12.227 --> 40:14.066
anything from Ni and Fang?

40:15.066 --> 40:16.347
I'm really worried.

40:17.146 --> 40:17.860
Mom.

40:18.360 --> 40:20.048
Dad.

40:21.947 --> 40:22.947
Ni!

40:33.347 --> 40:33.907
Let me see.

40:37.227 --> 40:38.347
What happened to your face?

40:39.493 --> 40:40.580
What about your body?

40:40.586 --> 40:41.907
I'm fine. Really.

40:46.106 --> 40:49.066
Dad, Mom, we're fine.

40:50.066 --> 40:51.307
We're back safe.

40:51.826 --> 40:52.940
That's all that matters.

40:53.471 --> 40:54.500
That's all that matters.

40:57.466 --> 40:58.427
Let's go home.

40:59.106 --> 41:01.026
I'll cook something good for you.

41:01.026 --> 41:02.066
Come on.

41:02.066 --> 41:02.747
Let's go.

41:30.506 --> 41:31.307
Mujing.

42:25.146 --> 42:25.827
I'm fine.

42:28.506 --> 42:29.747
You were there for 35 days.

42:32.146 --> 42:33.707
I saved 112 people.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
